OL,3,A'Cockroach' group leaders among
OL,4,Ahundreds detained in Delhi protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of protesters have reportedly
OL,7,Fbeen detained in Delhi during the
OL,8,Flatest demonstration by the Gen-Z led
OL,9,FCockroach Janta Party (CJP) over
OL,10,Felectoral reforms.
OL,12,FThe group said its founder Abhijeet
OL,13,FDipke, who began the movement in May
OL,14,Fafter India's Chief Justice likened
OL,15,Fsome jobless young people to
OL,16,F"cockroaches", was detained with other
OL,17,Fleaders shortly after landing in Delhi.
OL,19,FTens of thousands of security personnel
OL,20,Fwere deployed and roads barricaded
OL,21,Fahead of the demonstration, though the
OL,22,FCJP insisted it would go ahead.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
